{"dur": 21.7, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Il est deux heures du matin.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 2.746, "words": [{"w": "Il", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "est", "t": 1.366}, {"w": "deux", "t": 1.587}, {"w": "heures", "t": 1.863}, {"w": "du", "t": 2.249}, {"w": "matin.", "t": 2.415}]}, {"id": "scene", "text": "Tu redessines la même poutre. Pour la troisième fois.", "t0": 3.646, "t1": 6.831, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "t": 3.646}, {"w": "redessines", "t": 3.83}, {"w": "la", "t": 4.504}, {"w": "même", "t": 4.687}, {"w": "poutre.", "t": 4.994}, {"w": "Pour", "t": 5.422}, {"w": "la", "t": 5.728}, {"w": "troisième", "t": 5.912}, {"w": "fois.", "t": 6.525}]}, {"id": "raison", "text": "Parce que la section a bougé de cinq centimètres.", "t0": 7.211, "t1": 10.171, "words": [{"w": "Parce", "t": 7.211}, {"w": "que", "t": 7.573}, {"w": "la", "t": 7.815}, {"w": "section", "t": 7.996}, {"w": "a", "t": 8.479}, {"w": "bougé", "t": 8.6}, {"w": "de", "t": 8.963}, {"w": "cinq", "t": 9.144}, {"w": "centimètres.", "t": 9.446}]}, {"id": "verite", "text": "Et tu sais très bien que ce n'est pas ça, ton métier.", "t0": 10.551, "t1": 12.927, "words": [{"w": "Et", "t": 10.551}, {"w": "tu", "t": 10.688}, {"w": "sais", "t": 10.825}, {"w": "très", "t": 11.054}, {"w": "bien", "t": 11.282}, {"w": "que", "t": 11.511}, {"w": "ce", "t": 11.693}, {"w": "n'est", "t": 11.831}, {"w": "pas", "t": 12.105}, {"w": "ça,", "t": 12.288}, {"w": "ton", "t": 12.425}, {"w": "métier.", "t": 12.607}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "C'est pour ces nuits-là qu'on écrit CivRebar AI.", "t0": 13.307, "t1": 16.368, "words": [{"w": "C'est", "t": 13.307}, {"w": "pour", "t": 13.698}, {"w": "ces", "t": 14.024}, {"w": "nuits-là", "t": 14.284}, {"w": "qu'on", "t": 14.805}, {"w": "écrit", "t": 15.196}, {"w": "CivRebar", "t": 15.586}, {"w": "AI.", "t": 16.172}]}, {"id": "fin", "text": "Abonne-toi. Et rentre chez toi.", "t0": 16.748, "t1": 18.717, "words": [{"w": "Abonne-toi.", "t": 16.748}, {"w": "Et", "t": 17.427}, {"w": "rentre", "t"